 # Changelog
 
+## 1.5.0
+
+- Discount codes: `SPRING10` takes 10 % off the items; `WELCOME5` takes 5.00 € off items of 30.00 € or more. Shipping is
+  never discounted. An order takes one code at most.
+
 ## 1.4.0
 
 - Orders keep the date they were placed on.
